# Manufacturer Playbook Compatibility Router

This legacy filename remains for compatibility with earlier callers. The staged coach must not load this entire file as a one-shot playbook. Route to one current reference instead:

| Old concern | Current reference |
|---|---|
| business/product setup | `stage-00-workbench.md`, then `stage-01-product-kit.md` |
| market and ICP | `stage-02-market-icp.md` |
| prospect search and screening | `stage-03-prospecting.md` |
| outreach | `stage-04-outreach.md` |
| replies and follow-up | `stage-05-replies.md` |
| quotation, samples, negotiation | `stage-06-quotation.md` |
| orders, payment, logistics, documents | `stage-07-order-delivery.md` |
| review | `stage-08-review.md` |

The current completion gate is observable evidence for the selected level, not generation of a full 30-day plan. Use `progress-card.md` after meaningful actions.

